<section class="section manifesto" id="manifesto" aria-labelledby="manifesto-title">
  <div class="manifesto-quote" id="manifesto-title" data-reveal>
    Good design does not decorate the brand. It clarifies it.
  </div>
  <div class="manifesto-copy" data-reveal>
    <p>I design brand visuals for founders, restaurants, lifestyle businesses, creators, and campaign teams that need to feel clear, confident, and memorable.</p>
    <p>Good design does not mean adding more effects. It means choosing the right type, image, hierarchy, rhythm, and restraint so the brand feels intentional in the first second.</p>
    <p>The work is not a set of isolated graphics. It is a visual language your brand can repeat, extend, and be remembered for.</p>
  </div>
</section>
